     8243      run gds-attr-value in this-procedure  (
     8244                                             input cash-gds.gds-code
     8245                                            ,input 'ban-bonus':U
     8246                                            ,output v-ban-bonus
     8247                                            ,output v-type) no-error.
     8248     assign
