     8298   .
     8299   run ibm-gdsc in this-procedure (input no
     8300                                 , output cash-gds.ean-lz
     8301                                 , output cash-gds.ean-rz
     8302                                 , output cash-gds.code-short
     8303                                 ) no-error .
     8304   if new-good then new-good = not new-good.
     8305   if action = "U" then do:
     8306     if cash-gds.kat-discnt-rule <> 0
     8307     and how-pcnt-kat = 'pcnt-kat-pdf':U
     8308     then do:
